{"3123790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vacunauts", "steam_appid": 3123790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vacunauts</strong> is a <strong>chaotic 1-4 player multiplayer co-op wave defense</strong> game. You and your intergalactic cleaning crew were hired to <strong>protect planets</strong> threatened by the evil and nefarious &quot;Rubbish Rebels&quot;. Armed with a wide array of <strong>fun abilities</strong>, you'll need to band together in perfect harmony (or chaotic disarray) to <strong>defend the galaxy (and get a promotion)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123790/extras/383c75928903d7ad72df0365187d7d6e.webp?t=1774615500\" width=617 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up as one of various, highly motivated, employees of the cutest Company. <strong>Get together with up to 3 friends, online  or on your couch</strong>, and work diligently on your mission to defend planets all across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123790/extras/7779a9be6ab2e7a80eeb8a84ed839752.poster.avif?t=1774615500\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123790/extras/7779a9be6ab2e7a80eeb8a84ed839752.webm?t=1774615500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123790/extras/7779a9be6ab2e7a80eeb8a84ed839752.mp4?t=1774615500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b